    "detailed_description": "<h1>Unreal Engine Rewrite</h1><p>Greetings!\r\nI'm pleased to announce that Emergence has been rewritten in Unreal Engine 4.25 and now supports Valve Index and Oculus. \r\n\r\nRewriting the application in Unreal engine took considerable effort, but I feel that it was well worth the performance boost. \r\nIf you're operating without a VR headset, check the community page for a guide on how to bring up the Desktop Overlay interface.\r\n\r\nKind Regards,\r\n~W</p><br><h1>About the Software</h1>Explore Fractals in Virtual Reality. Learn about Fractals and adjust parameters to see the how fractals work. Enjoy the psychedelic shapes that mathematics has to offer. Meditative soundtrack included ~\r\n\r\nUpdate: Rewritten in Unreal engine 4",
